{"lyrics":"[Instrumental Intro]\n[Intro: Juice WRLD & Yuna]\n[00:04.42]Yeah\n[00:04.58]I want us forever\n[00:08.54]I want you forever\n[00:08.98]I want this forever\n[00:11.46](DRMZ, you a fool for this one)\n[00:14.06]I love you, listen\n[00:14.44](Forever in my mind, only you)\n[00:16.00](The pieces in my life go away with you) I really care for you\n[00:17.60](Forever in my mind, only you) I really do\n[00:25.50](The pieces in my life) Listen (Go away with you)\n[00:27.98](Forever in my mind, only you)\n[Verse 1: Juice WRLD]\n[00:39.96]Forever, forever\n[00:41.10]She stay on my mind like forever, forever (Forever, forever)\n[00:44.78]For worse or for better\n[00:46.00]I'm willing to fight for her heart, it's a pleasure (I really am)\n[00:49.62]Hope she get the message\n[00:50.84]I swear she an angel, that's word back to Heaven (That's word to God)\n[00:54.44]Man, fuck all the stressing and fighting\n[00:56.40]I want you forever, forever (I want you forever)\n[00:59.44]I'm writing these verses\n[01:00.60]Rehearse it, record it and play it at your request (And play it at your request)\n[01:04.30]I feel like it's us two forever\n[01:05.94]But I think that we just don't know it yet (Don't think that we know it yet)\n[01:08.94]I swear life is a bitch\n[01:10.04]I'ma toss it a bone, 'cause I feel like it's playing fetch (I feel like it's playing fetch)\n[01:13.84]You keepin' my heart or you tossin' it?\n[01:15.86]Baby, I know I hate playing catch (You know I hate playing catch)\n[01:18.66]Forever, forever\n[01:20.06]Say that no matter no weather (Right)\n[01:21.90]Heart getting colder than winter\n[01:23.52]But I say, \"No matter the weather,\" and don't you forget it (Right)\n[01:26.86]I look at love and then have all these questions (Right)\n[01:29.16]I look at you and then get all these answers (Right)\n[01:31.72]Fuck all these hoes, can you please mind my manners? (Right)\n[01:34.12]Monkey around, 'cause you drive me bananas (Right)\n[01:36.56]You put the nails to my hammer\n[01:38.22]Without you, I'm deadly like cancer, think of your answer\n[01:41.24]I feel like it's us and the planet and baby, I'm not being antsy\n[01:44.76]I'm just hoping you understand me\n[01:46.88]Look what you do to me, this is so crazy, yeah\n[01:49.72]I'm happy to call you my lady, yeah\n[01:52.10]I'm happy to say we together\n[01:53.92]And I hope this shit last forever, forever, yeah\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD & Yuna]\n[01:55.88](Forever in my mind, only you\n[01:56.60]The pieces in my life go away with you) Yeah\n[01:57.70](Forever in my mind, o-o-only you)\n[01:59.64]I love you\n[02:09.04](The pieces in my life go-go-go away with you)\n[02:13.42]I hope you feelin' this as much as I am\n[02:14.54](Forever in my mind, only you)\n[02:17.70]Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah\n[02:22.48](The pieces in my life go away with you)\n[02:28.34]Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah\n[02:28.80](Forever in my mind, only you)\n[02:29.46]It's really crazy how I feel about you\n[02:34.36](The pieces in my life go away with you)\n[02:36.50]This one finna get personal though, check (Mind)\n[Verse 2: Juice WRLD]\n[02:37.52]I'm losin' my mind\n[02:38.04]I'm losin' my mind, you drivin' me crazy (Mind; I'm goin' insane)\n[02:41.08]The shit we got into\n[02:42.34]The shit that we been through, shit, life is amazing (I swear, life is amazing) I'm not going nowhere\n[02:47.22]You not going nowhere, so baby, just face it\n[02:49.66]You're perfectly perfect for me\n[02:51.64]Baby, I'm able to actually give you this label, my queen\n[02:55.28]Girl, you deserve it\n[02:56.30]We been through our bullshit but, girl, it was worth it\n[02:58.70]I found Mrs. Right, I can't do no more searchin'\n[03:01.38]Fuck all the clownin' shit, this not a circus\n[03:03.64]I love for a reason, I love for a purpose\n[03:06.22]Wasn't an accident, this is on purpose\n[03:08.64]Put that on God, I can't do no more merchin' (No)\n[03:11.02]Don't turn your back, I can't take no more hurtin' (No)\n[03:13.44]Baby, I swear your love get me the highest\n[03:15.72]I look down below and I think that I'm flying (Yeah)\n[03:18.16]But really I'm falling, falling in love with you (Yeah)\n[03:20.72]Girl, it's because of you, girl, you the finest (Yeah)\n[03:23.18]Searching for love and you just helped me find it (Yeah)\n[03:25.58]Let's leave the bullshit and garbage behind us (Yeah)\n[03:28.00]Fuck the mistakes, let's not let them remind us\n[03:30.20]'Cause we at the top and let's do some more climbing\n[03:32.82]Girl, at this point, I'm pretty sure now you know just what you do to me\n[03:36.42]This shit that's new to me, girl\n[03:38.22]Finding my way through this jungle of life and it's foolery\n[03:41.26]So just get used to me, girl\n[03:42.98]I'm new to relationships, usually girls be abusing me\n[03:46.08]They just be using me, girl\n[03:47.90]This got me thinking forever, no matter no weather\n[03:50.72]That it's gon' be you and me, girl (Yeah)\n[Outro: Juice WRLD & Yuna]\n[04:02.04](Forever in my mind, only you)\n[04:08.28]Yeah\n[04:08.54](The pieces in my life go away with you)\n[04:11.64]Yeah\n[04:11.90](Forever in my mind, only you)\n[04:22.18]Yeah, yeah\n[04:25.78](The pieces in my life go away with you)\n[04:30.70]And that's how I feel, for real\n[04:31.86](Forever in my mind, only you\n[04:32.64]The pieces in my life go away with you)\n[04:33.76]I love you\n[04:34.00](Forever in my mind, only you\n[04:34.58]The pieces in my life go away with you)\n[04:35.62]I love you\n[04:35.84](Forever in my mind)","words":[[4.42,4.54,"Yeah"],[4.58,4.58,"I"],[4.62,4.7,"want"],[4.78,5.06,"us"],[6.14,8.48,"forever"],[8.54,8.54,"I"],[8.58,8.68,"want"],[8.72,8.78,"you"],[8.82,8.94,"forever"],[8.98,8.98,"I"],[9.02,9.08,"want"],[9.14,9.2,"this"],[9.24,9.48,"forever"],[11.46,11.74,"(DRMZ,"],[11.78,11.84,"you"],[11.88,11.88,"a"],[11.94,12.08,"fool"],[12.2,12.28,"for"],[13.82,13.88,"this"],[13.98,14.02,"one)"],[14.06,14.06,"I"],[14.1,14.18,"love"],[14.22,14.26,"you,"],[14.3,14.4,"listen"],[14.44,14.66,"(Forever"